169
00:13:01,664 --> 00:13:08,164
Ah, recently there have been similar products of
our imported toys circulating in the Kansai area

170
00:13:09,150 --> 00:13:11,203
What I inquired about is a murder case

171
00:13:12,851 --> 00:13:18,524
Yesterday, a man named Mizusawa, an executive of a Yakuza group in Osaka, was killed

172
00:13:19,330 --> 00:13:22,695
This note was found in the man's clothing.

173
00:13:31,016 --> 00:13:32,196
Yakuza member

174
00:13:33,110 --> 00:13:35,141
Do you have any idea about the gang member?

175
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,736
As you can see,

176
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:42,141
I am mainly engaged in the import and export of high-end toys

177
00:13:42,743 --> 00:13:44,712
We have nothing with Yakuza

178
00:13:44,737 --> 00:13:47,031
