Tamako.

207
00:16:18,456 --> 00:16:20,414
If the egg is up, what's her name?

208
00:16:20,485 --> 00:16:21,626
I'm telling you.

209
00:16:21,651 --> 00:16:23,329
I'm Tamako Tamamura.

210
00:16:23,821 --> 00:16:26,344
I see, her name is Tamako so it comes from golden egg.

211
00:16:26,469 --> 00:16:27,102
Yeah.

212
00:16:27,127 --> 00:16:29,133
It seems like a joke, but it looks like a girl log

213
