You know what?

214
00:16:30,269 --> 00:16:35,695
This girl used to work at a diner in front of the cycling track where I used to work.

215
00:16:35,970 --> 00:16:38,896
She doesn't have family, feeling quite lonely

216
00:16:38,951 --> 00:16:40,891
But she has a bright spirit, and that's her pride

