269
00:18:26,401 --> 00:18:29,898
Even if you predict for 10 minutes,you can earn about 100 yen in that time

270
00:18:29,923 --> 00:18:30,781
Shut up.

271
00:18:30,977 --> 00:18:31,953
You scared me.

272
00:18:33,954 --> 00:18:38,453
Do you know about silent pistols?

273
00:18:39,570 --> 00:18:40,469
I know a little about that.

274
00:18:40,928 --> 00:18:41,812
Do you know?

275
00:18:43,289 --> 00:18:44,640
This is it

276
00:18:45,122 --> 00:18:46,554
so I'll take 100 yen

277
00:18:48,815 --> 00:18:50,090
Don't be stingy

278
00:18:50,621 --> 00:18:54,625
this Kamoi-style dictionary is
something the Metropolitan Police doesn't have

279
00:18:55,078 --> 00:18:56,031
1 min

280
00:19:00,813 --> 00:19:01,516
Thanks.

281
00:19:02,633 --> 00:19:03,906
Look at this.

282
00:19:07,375 --> 00:19:08,835
Should I translate this?

283
00:19:08,860 --> 00:19:09,943
In other words,

284
00:19:09,968 --> 00:19:10,546
Just leave it alone.

285
00:19:10,770 --> 00:19:11,757
I won't ask you

286
00:19:12,382 --> 00:19:13,646
Do you even understand foreign words?

287
00:19:13,670 --> 00:19:14,406
Of course.

288
00:19:14,430 --> 00:19:16,242
You're on a different level than me, aren't you?

289
00:19:16,707 --> 00:19:19,707
Seriously, you're just like a clumsy person

290
00:19:19,828 --> 00:19:20,703
2 mins

291
00:19:26,063 --> 00:19:26,703
Welcome.

292
00:19:33,661 --> 00:19:35,491
Where did Tamako go?

293
00:19:35,789 --> 00:19:38,828
I paid for the travel expenses, but she disappeared.

294
00:19:38,867 --> 00:19:40,929
It was just 20 yen,
You shouldn't exaggerate.

295
00:19:41,085 --> 00:19:42,460
But...

296
00:19:42,537 --> 00:19:45,975
But I think it's really cute that she escaped by riding the train for free.

297
00:19:46,008 --> 00:19:48,998
Really, but where did she go?

298
00:19:49,023 --> 00:19:51,226
I am worried about her getting hit on by men in Tokyo.

299
00:19:52,273 --> 00:19:54,066
You're so noisy,aren't you?

300
00:19:54,090 --> 00:19:55,101
Then go look for it

301
00:19:55,202 --> 00:19:55,937
May I?

302
00:19:56,047 --> 00:19:56,742
Go ahead.

303
00:19:56,767 --> 00:19:57,437
Where are you going?

304
00:19:57,462 --> 00:19:58,601
I'll go around.

305
00:20:20,008 --> 00:20:20,625
Who?

306
00:20:24,054 --> 00:20:25,383
Why was I targeted?

307
00:20:26,975 --> 00:20:32,162
That pistol is amazing.
I can neither hear that sound nor see the fire.

308
00:21:02,436 --> 00:21:03,249
Where's Obata?

309
00:21:03,586 --> 00:21:04,187
In back room.

310
00:21:05,156 --> 00:21:06,851
You're late,Funayama

311
00:21:18,014 --> 00:21:20,663
Stop wasting shots

312
00:21:21,062 --> 00:21:23,969
You committed a senseless murder at the boat race track.

313
00:21:24,959 --> 00:21:27,455
Why do you target the Kamoi?

314
00:21:28,659 --> 00:21:30,077
Don't you know, big brother?

315
00:21:31,264 --> 00:21:39,577
That guy Kamoi was at the scene of the Mizusawa murder and was also involved with Kimura, the cop who took out Kubo

316
00:21:39,950 --> 00:21:44,285
Moreover, it seems he was the one who crushed the nightlife in Osaka with a single gun.

317
00:21:44,661 --> 00:21:45,231
That's right.

318
00:21:45,730 --> 00:21:49,090
Both the Tenchi and the Gamou group were definitely taken down by him

319
00:21:49,820 --> 00:21:54,075
I shot Osako because I saw him, and I won't stay silent

320
00:21:55,951 --> 00:21:57,395
I'll definitely kill him.

321
00:21:59,317 --> 00:22:03,106
Did you forget the boss's orders?
 I don't mind if the buyer kills him

322
00:22:03,750 --> 00:22:06,750
We must not shoot him with a pistol.

323
00:22:06,870 --> 00:22:09,636
We have a lot of business to do with this pistol from here on out.

324
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:11,636
If the police were to do this, this business could not operate.

325
00:22:11,660 --> 00:22:12,387
Be careful!

326
00:22:33,091 --> 00:22:34,630
I need to make a little more effort.

327
00:22:57,801 --> 00:22:59,160
I'm horny.

328
00:23:07,355 --> 00:23:10,137
Tsune! What are you doing?

329
00:23:11,325 --> 00:23:12,661
Hey!

330
00:23:13,848 --> 00:23:14,739
It was nice.

331
00:23:14,937 --> 00:23:16,035
What are you doing?

332
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:17,380
I found a big cockroach

333
00:23:17,466 --> 00:23:18,380
I'll kill it.

334
00:23:18,405 --> 00:23:20,246
You don't have to.

335
00:23:20,559 --> 00:23:21,239
What's the hell?

336
00:23:23,841 --> 00:23:24,833
You know what?

337
00:23:25,513 --> 00:23:27,098
I wonder where Tamako-san has gone.

338
00:23:27,123 --> 00:23:28,606
She has completely disappeared.

339
00:23:28,700 --> 00:23:29,481
I see.

340
00:23:30,036 --> 00:23:32,934
This is caused by poverty in society.

341
00:23:33,731 --> 00:23:34,957
You talk about difficult subjects.

342
00:23:35,909 --> 00:23:39,278
She didn't have any money, so she rode the Shinkansen without paying.

343
00:23:39,575 --> 00:23:42,793
She mistakenly thought the police had come to arrest her.

344
00:23:44,426 --> 00:23:46,075
Even when I carry my guitar and play on the street,

345
00:23:46,100 --> 00:23:46,986
It's still a poor?

346
00:23:47,011 --> 00:23:47,645
That's right.

347
00:23:47,786 --> 00:23:48,489
What's this?

348
00:23:48,786 --> 00:23:49,903
Oh hand gun

349
00:23:50,233 --> 00:23:52,606
Look, it's just unbearable, this texture.

350
00:23:52,872 --> 00:23:54,700
Huh? It's been a while since I shot this.

351
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:57,762
I really want to see how good your skills are

352
00:24:04,075 --> 00:24:04,895
Tama-chan.

353
00:24:05,106 --> 00:24:06,325
You scared me.

354
00:24:07,051 --> 00:24:09,270
I might get killed!

355
00:24:09,645 --> 00:24:12,004
Where were you going?

356
00:24:12,388 --> 00:24:13,403
Is that male detective not coming anymore?

357
00:24:13,428 --> 00:24:14,061
It's okay if he comes.

358
00:24:14,895 --> 00:24:17,551
Please listen to my singing.

359
00:24:17,614 --> 00:24:19,595
I want to audition, you know?

360
00:24:19,620 --> 00:24:20,682
This is the guitar.

361
00:24:20,995 --> 00:24:22,222
What is an audition?

362
00:24:22,717 --> 00:24:24,315
An audition is a test, right?

363
00:24:24,340 --> 00:24:25,066
Yeah.

364
00:24:26,080 --> 00:24:27,370
I have one suggestion, though

365
00:24:28,078 --> 00:24:29,674
Huh? Shall we go?

366
00:24:34,159 --> 00:24:35,027
Welcome!

367
00:24:53,721 --> 00:24:56,540
I'm sorry, Dad, I'm late.

368
00:24:56,565 --> 00:24:57,736
Where have you been?

369
00:24:57,760 --> 00:24:59,073
I still haven't borrowed the clothes

370
00:24:59,464 --> 00:25:00,831
Hasn't your favorite band started yet?

371
00:25:01,097 --> 00:25:02,901
It is just about to start

372
00:25:03,995 --> 00:25:08,471
You are an older person, yet it is quite rare for someone your age to like young Latin music.

373
00:25:09,650 --> 00:25:11,626
Don't make fun of it

374
00:25:11,659 --> 00:25:13,596
I am not that old yet,

375
00:25:13,833 --> 00:25:15,356
Don't you think so too?

376
00:25:16,612 --> 00:25:19,316
I would like your autograph.

377
00:25:22,020 --> 00:25:23,167
Are you really okay?

378
00:25:23,207 --> 00:25:24,635
Just wait a minute

379
00:25:24,699 --> 00:25:29,424
I bought Jane's record to practice,Jane is my admired batter

380
00:25:29,660 --> 00:25:32,660
I think Jane's position is just perfect

381
00:25:34,581 --> 00:25:37,581
Ms. Jane, you have 5 minutes until your turn, so please hurry up

382
00:25:38,130 --> 00:25:39,220
That's impossible

383
00:25:39,620 --> 00:25:42,620
Her makeup will definitely take at least another 15 minutes

384
00:25:43,530 --> 00:25:45,134
However, the customer is waiting

385
00:25:45,670 --> 00:25:47,076
Isn't it fine to keep them waiting?

386
00:25:47,100 --> 00:25:48,861
That way the store can make more profit, right?

387
00:25:49,280 --> 00:25:51,361
Please do it as soon as possible, anyway

388
00:25:52,119 --> 00:25:53,385
Give me a lipstick.

389
00:25:56,635 --> 00:25:57,815
It's so noisy.

390
00:26:00,385 --> 00:26:01,096
Who?

391
00:26:02,502 --> 00:26:03,369
Jane,

392
00:26:03,870 --> 00:26:05,799
I really admire you.

393
00:26:06,209 --> 00:26:07,978
Thank you! Do you want my signature?

394
00:26:08,781 --> 00:26:12,641
I want you to listen to the song of a girl who is infatuated with you

395
00:26:13,309 --> 00:26:15,115
I don't have time for that, just go away

396
00:26:15,896 --> 00:26:20,220
Huh? If you make such a scary face, it won't be a beautiful face anymore, so please smile.

397
00:26:20,315 --> 00:26:22,104
You're irreplaceable, so stay away

398
00:26:22,131 --> 00:26:23,799
Why are you being so cold again

399
00:26:23,824 --> 00:26:25,002
kicking this man out

400
00:26:25,027 --> 00:26:25,768
Stay away

401
00:26:26,430 --> 00:26:28,181
I'm completely out of my mind now

402
00:26:28,276 --> 00:26:28,893
Get your hands off of me!

403
00:26:29,010 --> 00:26:29,586
I'll call someone!

404
00:26:29,610 --> 00:26:31,366
Don't be loud.

405
00:26:31,798 --> 00:26:33,993
What are you doing! Stop it!

406
00:26:34,018 --> 00:26:35,112
Be quiet!

407
00:26:35,830 --> 00:26:36,736
Sensei.

408
00:26:37,001 --> 00:26:37,955
Let's call the police!

409
00:26:39,114 --> 00:26:41,463
You have to spend about two hours redoing your makeup.

410
00:26:44,329 --> 00:26:45,477
He's crazy.

411
00:26:46,609 --> 00:26:47,867
Ladies and gentlemen,

412
00:26:48,102 --> 00:26:53,820
Club Gather presents tonight. A wonderful show performed
by Takashi Furuya & Freshman

413
00:26:58,046 --> 00:26:59,898
Singing passionate singer

414
00:27:00,087 --> 00:27:01,563
Jane Shimura

415
00:27:08,915 --> 00:27:10,688
I am Tamura Tamako.
Nice to meet you.

416
00:27:10,778 --> 00:27:11,824
She's not Jane, right?

417
00:27:15,320 --> 00:27:16,813
That's true. Yes

418
00:27:17,610 --> 00:27:18,102
Yes.

419
00:27:20,719 --> 00:27:21,665
Stop it.

420
00:27:21,852 --> 00:27:22,735
Who are you?

421
00:27:23,891 --> 00:27:25,133
Let me sing.

422
00:27:25,672 --> 00:27:27,438
I want to sing

423
00:27:27,985 --> 00:27:29,360
Please

424
00:27:32,282 --> 00:27:33,492
Let me sing.

425
00:27:33,517 --> 00:27:35,571
Please let her sing.

426
00:27:35,899 --> 00:27:37,469
This is a request from the president.

427
00:28:55,734 --> 00:28:57,344
Thank you very much

428
00:28:57,532 --> 00:28:58,665
A customer is waiting for you.

429
00:28:58,774 --> 00:28:59,719
I see.

430
00:29:04,287 --> 00:29:05,109
Hello, this is Tamako Tamamura.

431
00:29:05,134 --> 00:29:06,688
Thank you in advance

432
00:29:06,713 --> 00:29:08,201
It was quite good

433
00:29:08,313 --> 00:29:09,250
Really.

434
00:29:09,386 --> 00:29:11,672
Thank you for letting me sing.

435
00:29:11,697 --> 00:29:13,719
I'm glad I came all the way from Osaka.

436
00:29:13,744 --> 00:29:15,330
Thank you very much!

437
00:29:15,355 --> 00:29:16,591
It was wonderful!

438
00:29:16,844 --> 00:29:18,727
It's rare for my father to praise this much

439
00:29:18,752 --> 00:29:20,344
Have a seat.

440
00:29:22,406 --> 00:29:23,805
Do you want to become a singer?

441
00:29:23,830 --> 00:29:28,605
Yes,When I hear the rhythm, my body gets excited.

442
00:29:28,653 --> 00:29:30,492
My body is feeling all tingly, and soon I'll be singing

443
00:29:30,517 --> 00:29:34,758
Thank you very much, but there is someone else I should be saying thanks

444
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:38,846
Where are you,Kamoi?

445
00:29:38,885 --> 00:29:40,085
Please come over here!

446
00:29:40,360 --> 00:29:42,696
I wonder where Kamoi-san has gone

447
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:43,953
Mr. Kamoi!

448
00:29:46,383 --> 00:29:47,399
I'm here.

449
00:29:47,688 --> 00:29:49,196
Let me introduce everyone

450
00:29:49,220 --> 00:29:50,346
This is Mr. Daisuke Kamoi

451
00:29:50,370 --> 00:29:51,236
He promoted me.

452
00:29:51,260 --> 00:29:52,836
thank you for taking care of things!

453
00:29:52,861 --> 00:29:53,555
Nice to meet you

454
00:29:53,639 --> 00:29:55,430
I'm Nakazawa, nice to meet you too.

455
00:29:55,961 --> 00:29:57,563
Please have a seat

456
00:29:58,773 --> 00:30:01,286
Thank you very much.
You did well.

457
00:30:01,310 --> 00:30:02,473
I see

458
00:30:03,028 --> 00:30:04,841
This is my daughter Ritsuko.

459
00:30:04,930 --> 00:30:06,586
It's an honor to meet you.

460
00:30:06,618 --> 00:30:08,953
You are in adult mode 100%

461
00:30:09,188 --> 00:30:10,883
It's an honor to meet you.

462
00:30:11,439 --> 00:30:13,375
My secretary, Tachikawa-kun, is also here

463
00:30:13,532 --> 00:30:16,961
She's a beautiful like Cleo Butler

464
00:30:17,890 --> 00:30:19,806
What a fortunate night this is!

465
00:30:19,830 --> 00:30:22,180
President, you have a phone call

466
00:30:22,690 --> 00:30:23,914
Well then, excuse me

467
00:30:27,924 --> 00:30:31,016
Is he the owner of this club?

468
00:30:31,237 --> 00:30:35,531
He is the president of Nakazawa Trading Company, which manages this club

469
00:30:36,250 --> 00:30:40,164
Wow, he is an incredibly important person, isn't he?

470
00:30:43,821 --> 00:30:44,227
Please

471
00:30:44,252 --> 00:30:45,016
Thanks.

472
00:30:46,589 --> 00:30:48,328
Hello, this is Nakazawa

473
00:30:54,914 --> 00:30:55,598
I get it.

474
00:30:56,330 --> 00:30:57,891
Well then, I'm going home right away

475
00:31:00,750 --> 00:31:01,999
I'm really serious about this

476
00:31:02,130 --> 00:31:03,846
The Shinkansen is fast, I tell you

477
00:31:03,870 --> 00:31:05,976
It took 3 hours and 10 minutes from Osaka to Tokyo

478
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,286
During that time, just sitting on the toilet,

479
00:31:07,325 --> 00:31:09,195
anyone would get numb, right?

480
00:31:09,407 --> 00:31:10,626
Stop saying it.

481
00:31:10,949 --> 00:31:13,835
But I have to bow my head to that passion

482
00:31:15,500 --> 00:31:17,117
Oh, I apologize

483
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,546
What do you think?

484
00:31:18,570 --> 00:31:21,180
I want to hear more of Tamako's song

485
00:31:21,430 --> 00:31:23,289
Would you like to come home with me?

486
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:26,116
I want to talk while having a meal

487
00:31:26,140 --> 00:31:28,680
I'm really hungry.

488
00:31:28,705 --> 00:31:31,915
You have to behave elegantly.

489
00:31:33,139 --> 00:31:34,570
Be careful with your choice of words.

490
00:31:35,457 --> 00:31:40,383
I'm a little hungry now

491
00:31:40,408 --> 00:31:42,118
You are stupid.

492
00:31:46,908 --> 00:31:48,481
I see, I see.

493
00:31:48,801 --> 00:31:50,962
but you must have been surprised, right?

494
00:31:51,040 --> 00:31:54,111
Even though it's for the passion of Tamako

495
00:31:54,312 --> 00:31:56,165
I feel like I did something a bit wrong in the end

496
00:31:56,450 --> 00:31:58,189
It's okay, Kamoi-san

497
00:31:58,619 --> 00:32:00,515
I will let everyone know.

498
00:32:00,540 --> 00:32:02,517
I'm counting on you,

499
00:32:03,620 --> 00:32:06,620
I'm already dreaming, aren't I?

500
00:32:06,670 --> 00:32:07,815
It's not a dream.

501
00:32:08,120 --> 00:32:09,926
My father is really enthusiastic about it

502
00:32:09,950 --> 00:32:12,950
He says he wants to get a wonderful band for Tamako

503
00:32:13,220 --> 00:32:16,220
Is that a band exclusively for me?

504
00:32:16,689 --> 00:32:17,150
Yes

505
00:32:17,829 --> 00:32:22,688
How about joining our band starting tomorrow?

506
00:32:24,720 --> 00:32:27,267
Hey, Kamoi! Come here for a second!

507
00:32:27,519 --> 00:32:28,845
What?

508
00:32:34,759 --> 00:32:36,876
You know what?
She said....

509
00:32:43,344 --> 00:32:45,095
Stop! Stop it!

510
00:32:56,703 --> 00:32:58,587
That kid is quick on their feet

511
00:33:10,791 --> 00:33:11,556
Here it is.

512
00:33:21,189 --> 00:33:22,055
He fired a pistol from here.

513
00:33:23,500 --> 00:33:28,126
If he had a little better skills, I would be going to hell, no, heaven right now.

514
00:33:32,408 --> 00:33:33,392
It's fine now

515
00:33:34,267 --> 00:33:36,127
Call the police, call the police.

516
00:34:05,173 --> 00:34:06,042
Did I keep you waiting for a while?

517
00:34:06,075 --> 00:34:06,992
No, more than that,

518
00:34:07,017 --> 00:34:09,110
I suddenly called you, wasn't it a bother?

519
00:34:09,267 --> 00:34:10,049
No way.

520
00:34:10,548 --> 00:34:12,443
If you wanted to consult with me

521
00:34:12,580 --> 00:34:14,954
I can fly over immediately

522
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:18,165
So what is this consultation about?

523
00:34:21,352 --> 00:34:24,187
I wonder if the gun last night
was really aimed at Kamoi-san

524
00:34:24,212 --> 00:34:25,828
Why would someone target you?

525
00:34:25,853 --> 00:34:28,460
I believe it was someone who resents my father who shot

526
00:34:30,247 --> 00:34:33,247
Is there something about Mr. Nakazawa that makes people resent him?

527
00:34:33,661 --> 00:34:35,790
I don't really understand it either

528
00:34:36,580 --> 00:34:39,345
My father came back from abroad at the end of last year

529
00:34:39,742 --> 00:34:41,470
It's his first return in 15 years

530
00:34:42,630 --> 00:34:48,126
My uncle, who had been taking care of me, passed away, and the company needed a successor

531
00:34:49,687 --> 00:34:52,687
So I was really happy that my father came back

532
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:57,962
But lately, I've been feeling somewhat worried about it.

533
00:34:58,270 --> 00:35:02,993
My father often has nightmares at night or suddenly looks deep in thought with a scary expression

534
00:35:04,040 --> 00:35:07,040
It seems like he is always afraid of something

535
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:10,185
Kamoi, I'm begging you

536
00:35:10,510 --> 00:35:12,292
Could you please protect my father?

537
00:35:13,206 --> 00:35:14,116
Protect him?

538
00:35:15,396 --> 00:35:19,090
I have a feeling that something very bad is going to happen to my father soon.

539
00:35:19,267 --> 00:35:23,275
Oh, I think that's just your over thinking.

540
00:35:25,090 --> 00:35:28,099
But why are you telling me to be his bodyguard?

541
00:35:30,092 --> 00:35:33,092
Your gun handling last night was truly impressive.
I was amazed.

